{
  "$description": "Semantic color roles: the shadcn role names, kept verbatim, mapped onto the canonical --a63-* tokens. scripts/generate-role-bridges.mjs writes the semantic block of tailwind/theme.css (as --color-<role>) and compat/shadcn.css (as --<role>) from this file. `accent` is the neutral hover and highlight plate, not the brand color.",
